Third-party font

kernel/drivers/font_ttf.c and font_ttf.h contain anti-aliased glyph
bitmaps baked from JetBrains Mono (Regular), which is licensed under
the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, not the MIT License above.
The full OFL text is included at tools/OFL.txt and must accompany any
redistribution of that font data (or substantial rendered derivatives
of it), per the OFL's own terms. The MIT License above governs the
rest of this repository (all original toy-os source code).

---

Third-party data

seed/sync/usr/share/hwdata/pci.ids (seeded onto the disk image as
/usr/share/hwdata/pci.ids, and read by /bin/lspci) is a verbatim copy
of the PCI ID Database maintained by the PCI ID Project at
https://pci-ids.ucw.cz/. It is not covered by the MIT License above.

Upstream offers it under either the GNU General Public License version
2 or later, or the 3-clause BSD License. toy-os redistributes it under
the 3-clause BSD option, reproduced in full below. The file's own
header comments -- which name the maintainers and the license grant --
are preserved verbatim in the copy shipped here.

Copyright (c) The PCI ID Project contributors.
Copyright is held by Martin Mares and Albert Pool, and covers the
aggregation and formatting of the data only, the data itself being
factual.

